  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "The probability that a missile hits a target successfully is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>.</mo></math> In order to destroy the target completely, at least three successful hits are required. Then the minimum number of missiles that have to be fired so that the probability of completely destroying the target is not&nbsp;less than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>95</mn><mo>,</mo></math> is ___________",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the number of missiles be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> (of destroying the target) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>95</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>95</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>95</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>95</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>74</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;(not true)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>128</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>134</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;(not true)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>512</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>212</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;(not true)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2048</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>308</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;(true)</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>.</p>",
